WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.400
Say that one more time.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.180
Sure, I'll say it as many times as you like.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.610
I only tagged along with you kids...

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.190
to kill some time!

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:20.910
When did you...

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:27.540
I just love that moment when a child blazing 
with hope falls, trembling, into despair.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:31.840
They make such delectable expressions.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:33.550
Oh...

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.470
What a shame. If this 
weren't a Bubuki battle,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.060
I could have taken your life.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:44.740
I'm only interested in the man at the top...

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.060
But I'll settle for you just this once.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:52.430
Come, Hiiragi.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:00.290
In life, we follow in the tracks 
of those who came before.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:01.900
So...

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.960
Will you walk that path, or leave?

